+### §container-not-viewport — the shell's layout step follows the viewport
+- Since: 2026-10-23 (supersedes the 2026-09-15 decision; the user/maintainer explicitly overrode it)
+- Decision: the shell's layout step uses a viewport media query, `@media (min-width: 720px)`.
